      "displayName": "A. Soroka",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=557058%3A24c578cc-15e9-4649-9f68-5eace85735e0",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>There's an implicit question about the API here-- is the log message a required parameter or not? If not, this is clearly a bug as described, but if it is, the fact that the REST API allows \"log message -less\" ingest is the real bug. The REST API documentation is ambiguous on this point, to my eye.</p>",
