      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>Throughout the REST API, the log message can be omitted (whether it was intended to be optional or not).  Ingest is the only action I know of where an audit trail event is not created when no log message is supplied (various modify actions work fine without a log message, and an audit trail is created for those modifications).</p>",
